msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX2 pin. It supports all single wire RC "
"protocols except bi-directional serial protocols such as CRSF, ELRS, etc. "
"Instead, these devices can be connected using both TX2 and RX2 if if "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
